WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.782
"This show is terrible," said Terrell.

2
00:00:16.783 --> 00:00:20.477
Terrell, Mara, and Jack were still watching Mr. Presto.

3
00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:26.387
The magician had just made an old man's cane disappear.

4
00:00:26.388 --> 00:00:29.813
"Where's Mighty Man?" asked Jack.

5
00:00:29.814 --> 00:00:38.281
Suddenly Mara shouted. "Rocket Girl is on TV!"

6
00:00:38.282 --> 00:00:42.011
Detective Smith and the TV crew were still watching the monitor.

7
00:00:42.012 --> 00:00:45.088
"Whoa!" said the Mighty Man actor.

8
00:00:45.089 --> 00:00:47.639
"It's Rocket Girl!"

9
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:51.842
Mr. Presto was about to make a little girl's lollipop disappear.

10
00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:55.205
"One, two, three . . ."

11
00:00:55.206 --> 00:00:59.040
"Stop right there, Mr. Presto!" Roxy yelled.

12
00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:03.198
Mr. Presto spun around, and the little girl ran away.

13
00:01:03.199 --> 00:01:06.705
"Rocket Girl!" said Mr. Presto.

14
00:01:06.706 --> 00:01:08.908
"I was hoping you would appear.

15
00:01:08.909 --> 00:01:12.209
Now my show will be very exciting!"

16
00:01:12.210 --> 00:01:15.589
"Your show is over," said Roxy.

17
00:01:15.590 --> 00:01:17.648
Mr. Presto smiled.

18
00:01:17.649 --> 00:01:19.842
"Oh no, it's not!

19
00:01:19.843 --> 00:01:23.673
In a moment I'll perform my most amazing trick.

20
00:01:23.674 --> 00:01:28.839
I'm going to make all the money in Metro City Bank disappear!"

21
00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:32.029
"No, you're not," said Roxy.

22
00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:34.626
Mr. Presto raised an eyebrow.

23
00:01:34.627 --> 00:01:38.614
"I'm not? Who's going to stop me?"

24
00:01:38.615 --> 00:01:42.774
"I am," said Roxy.

25
00:01:42.775 --> 00:01:45.583
She ran toward Mr. Presto.

26
00:01:45.584 --> 00:01:49.572
Mr. Presto waved his wand. "Presto!"

27
00:01:49.573 --> 00:01:52.657
A wall appeared in front of Roxy.

28
00:01:52.658 --> 00:01:55.685
Bam! Roxy crashed into it.

29
00:01:55.686 --> 00:01:59.067
Mr. Presto laughed.

30
00:01:59.068 --> 00:02:03.799
"This is turning out to be such a great show!"

31
00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.528
"Grr!" Roxy growled, rubbing her head.

32
00:02:07.529 --> 00:02:12.138
She jumped over the wall and landed in front of Mr. Presto.

33
00:02:12.139 --> 00:02:14.154
She tried to grab him.

34
00:02:14.155 --> 00:02:16.853
"Presto!" said the magician.

35
00:02:16.854 --> 00:02:19.869
Poof! He disappeared.

36
00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.485
Roxy looked from side to side.

37
00:02:22.486 --> 00:02:25.822
"Where did Mr. Presto go?" she wondered.

38
00:02:25.823 --> 00:02:28.832
She took a few steps, looking carefully.

39
00:02:28.833 --> 00:02:31.835
She felt someone tap her on the shoulder.

40
00:02:31.836 --> 00:02:34.857
"Here I am!" said Mr. Presto.

41
00:02:34.858 --> 00:02:36.668
Roxy spun around.

42
00:02:36.669 --> 00:02:40.608
Poof! Mr. Presto disappeared again.

43
00:02:40.609 --> 00:02:43.499
Roxy didn't see the magician anywhere.

44
00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:46.139
"Hey!" she yelled.

45
00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:50.022
"Mr. Presto! Why don't you come out and face me?

46
00:02:50.023 --> 00:02:52.578
Or are you too scared?"

47
00:02:52.579 --> 00:02:55.964
Poof! Mr. Presto appeared nearby.

48
00:02:55.965 --> 00:03:00.611
"I'm the world's greatest magician!" said Mr. Presto.

49
00:03:00.612 --> 00:03:07.787
"I'm not scared of a silly little girl."

50
00:03:07.788 --> 00:03:10.253
Roxy glared at Mr. Presto.

51
00:03:10.254 --> 00:03:12.882
"A silly little girl?

52
00:03:12.883 --> 00:03:16.006
You're going to regret saying that!"

53
00:03:16.007 --> 00:03:19.352
Roxy shot toward Mr. Presto like a rocket.

54
00:03:19.353 --> 00:03:22.533
"Presto!" said Mr. Presto.

55
00:03:22.534 --> 00:03:25.281
A big black box appeared in front of him.

56
00:03:25.282 --> 00:03:28.211
Roxy was flying too fast to stop.

57
00:03:28.212 --> 00:03:30.557
She slammed right into the box.

58
00:03:30.558 --> 00:03:33.414
Mr. Presto quickly closed it shut.

59
00:03:33.415 --> 00:03:37.087
"One, two, three . . . Presto!"

60
00:03:37.088 --> 00:03:40.307
Mara, Jack, and Terrell stared at the TV screen.

61
00:03:40.308 --> 00:03:42.244
They all gasped.

62
00:03:42.245 --> 00:03:48.187
"Uh-oh!" cried Terrell.
